WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.968
-House Republicans voted
in large numbers

00:00:02.968 --> 00:00:05.167
against a bill that would
provide emergency funding

00:00:05.167 --> 00:00:07.534
to address the nationwide
shortage of baby formula,

00:00:07.534 --> 00:00:09.501
while a smaller number
of Republicans

00:00:09.501 --> 00:00:12.367
voted against a second bill,
that would make it easier

00:00:12.367 --> 00:00:14.200
for poor families
to buy formula.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:17.000
Instead, Republicans would much
rather exploit the crisis

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.400
to rail against immigration.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:20.501
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:20.501 --> 00:00:24.601
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:24.601 --> 00:00:27.667
In case you have any doubt
at all that reality is,

00:00:27.667 --> 00:00:30.367
in fact, a simulation
and we're all just test subjects

00:00:30.367 --> 00:00:32.734
in some giant computer game,
being jerked around

00:00:32.734 --> 00:00:35.300
for the entertainment
of our celestial overlords,

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:37.801
[ Laughter ]
here's an extremely
and shockingly real clip

00:00:37.801 --> 00:00:39.634
of former
President George W. Bush

00:00:39.634 --> 00:00:41.100
giving a speech yesterday

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:43.467
where he discussed
Russia's invasion of Ukraine

00:00:43.467 --> 00:00:47.167
and accidentally confessed
to being a war criminal.

00:00:47.167 --> 00:00:50.067
[ Laughter ]
-Russian elections are rigged.

00:00:50.067 --> 00:00:52.734
Political opponents
are imprisoned

00:00:52.734 --> 00:00:54.467
or otherwise eliminated

00:00:54.467 --> 00:00:58.367
from participating
in the electoral process.

00:00:58.367 --> 00:01:03.033
The result is an absence
of checks and balances in Russia

00:01:03.033 --> 00:01:09.467
and the decision of one man
to launch a wholly unjustified

00:01:09.467 --> 00:01:12.067
and brutal invasion of Iraq.

00:01:12.067 --> 00:01:13.467
I mean, of Ukraine.
[ Chuckle ]

00:01:13.467 --> 00:01:15.167
[ Laughter ]
Iraq, too.

00:01:15.167 --> 00:01:18.200
Anyway.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:19.701
Seventy-five.

00:01:19.701 --> 00:01:22.534
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:25.133 --> 00:01:26.801
You know,
when I started this show,

00:01:26.801 --> 00:01:28.767
I poured exactly
one shot of whiskey

00:01:28.767 --> 00:01:31.000
and left it in the drawer
of my desk for an emergency

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:32.934
and, throughout the entirety
of the Trump presidency,

00:01:32.934 --> 00:01:34.968
I resisted using it,
but you know what? [Bleep] it.

00:01:34.968 --> 00:01:37.968
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:44.734
I really am certain that clip
was designed in a lab

00:01:44.734 --> 00:01:47.267
to melt the brains of anyone
who was alive in 2003.

00:01:47.267 --> 00:01:50.000
Back then, if you had called
the invasion of Iraq

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:51.100
brutal and unjustified,

00:01:51.100 --> 00:01:52.834
the Bush administration
and Fox News

00:01:52.834 --> 00:01:55.033
would've spent an entire week
calling you a traitor

00:01:55.033 --> 00:01:56.801
and, anytime you went
to the airport,

00:01:56.801 --> 00:01:59.400
the TSA would've given you
the full cavity search.

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:01.100
[ Laughter ]
[ Southern accent ]
Well, well, well, Mr. Meyers,

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:05.033
if it isn't 3.5 ounces
of toothpaste.

00:02:05.033 --> 00:02:07.200
Squat and cough, joke boy.

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:08.367
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:08.367 --> 00:02:10.400
Remember, this was a time
in our history

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:13.000
that was so hysterical
and intolerant of dissent

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:15.901
that people started calling
French fries, freedom fries,

00:02:15.901 --> 00:02:18.734
because France opposed the war,

00:02:18.734 --> 00:02:20.367
[ Laughter ]
which was both petty
and pointless,

00:02:20.367 --> 00:02:22.434
especially because we only
did it for French fries.

00:02:22.434 --> 00:02:24.834
We didn't change French kissing
or French doors

00:02:24.834 --> 00:02:27.968
or Mr. French and we didn't all
pretend that Larry Bird was

00:02:27.968 --> 00:02:30.868
from Freedom Lick, Indiana.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.868 --> 00:02:33.300
You know, what people don't
remember is that, to retaliate,

00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:36.033
French people started calling
American cheese disgusting

00:02:36.033 --> 00:02:37.334
100 years ago.

00:02:37.334 --> 00:02:39.934
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:39.934 --> 00:02:42.801
There is a direct line
from Bush to the modern GOP.

00:02:42.801 --> 00:02:44.968
The Trump Republican Party
is the natural evolution

00:02:44.968 --> 00:02:46.033
of the Bush Republican Party,

00:02:46.033 --> 00:02:47.434
which was lawless
and authoritarian

00:02:47.434 --> 00:02:50.100
and used culture war hysteria
to stir up resentments

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:51.801
and scare voters, the same way

00:02:51.801 --> 00:02:53.667
the modern Republican Party
does now.

00:02:53.667 --> 00:02:55.434
They've just switched
to different topics.

00:02:55.434 --> 00:02:58.000
Back then, Bush wanted
to amend the Constitution

00:02:58.000 --> 00:02:59.167
to ban gay marriage.

00:02:59.167 --> 00:03:01.300
Now, Republicans want
to take baby formula

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:03.968
away from migrant children
in government custody.

00:03:03.968 --> 00:03:05.300
-Our border children,

00:03:05.300 --> 00:03:06.868
the illegal
immigrant children,

00:03:06.868 --> 00:03:08.300
are getting formula.

00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:09.934
-American families,
there's a shortage,

00:03:09.934 --> 00:03:11.367
but if you're a migrant,
don't worry

00:03:11.367 --> 00:03:14.968
because Uncle Sam
has a stash of that.

00:03:14.968 --> 00:03:17.300
-These are not people
that respected our borders,

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:19.267
our laws,
and our sovereignty.

00:03:19.267 --> 00:03:23.200
Why wouldn't all the pallets go
to American families, first?

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:26.367
-Apparently, there's no shortage
of baby formula

00:03:26.367 --> 00:03:27.734
for illegal aliens.

00:03:27.734 --> 00:03:30.901
Why are we feeding illegal
babies ahead of American babies?

00:03:30.901 --> 00:03:32.267
-Illegal babies?

00:03:32.267 --> 00:03:34.434
[ Laughter ]
Are you out of your
[bleep] mind?

00:03:34.434 --> 00:03:35.901
[ Laughter ]
You know what?

00:03:35.901 --> 00:03:37.901
I think I'm finally going
to drink that whiskey shot.

00:03:37.901 --> 00:03:38.634
Oh, right!

00:03:38.634 --> 00:03:40.400
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:41.801
I already had it today!

00:03:41.801 --> 00:03:44.501
I made it almost 1,300 shows
and then I need it twice

00:03:44.501 --> 00:03:46.234
in one "Look."
Look,

00:03:46.234 --> 00:03:48.567
[ Laughter ]
as a rule, if you ever find
yourself uttering the words,

00:03:48.567 --> 00:03:50.400
"Why are we feeding
illegal babies?",

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:52.968
or even just the words
"illegal babies,"

00:03:52.968 --> 00:03:55.200
that's when you need to go in
for a CAT scan,

00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:57.100
to see if the doctors
can find your soul.

00:03:57.100 --> 00:03:59.834
[ Laughter ]
"No, we're -- we're looking
and it's just

00:03:59.834 --> 00:04:02.934
a giant, blank void
where the soul should be."

00:04:02.934 --> 00:04:05.501
[ Laughter ]
Also, again, think about how
insane and immoral

00:04:05.501 --> 00:04:07.234
the phrase "illegal babies" is.

00:04:07.234 --> 00:04:08.767
Babies can't be illegal.

00:04:08.767 --> 00:04:09.901
They can't commit crimes.

00:04:09.901 --> 00:04:13.300
You've never seen a gang
of babies on motorcycles

00:04:13.300 --> 00:04:14.767
[ Laughter ]
holding up liquor stores.

00:04:14.767 --> 00:04:16.634
And, even if you did,
it'd be cute as [bleep].

00:04:16.634 --> 00:04:19.334
[ Laughter ]
I mean, my God,
these are babies!

00:04:19.334 --> 00:04:21.934
By the way,
in the government's custody.

00:04:21.934 --> 00:04:25.033
It would be, to put it mildly,
immoral, abomination,

00:04:25.033 --> 00:04:27.033
and crime against humanity not
to feed them.

00:04:27.033 --> 00:04:29.133
And, on top of being
ghoulish and horrific,

00:04:29.133 --> 00:04:30.734
it wouldn't even solve anything.

00:04:30.734 --> 00:04:34.167
-First of all, how many babies
are there at the border?

00:04:34.167 --> 00:04:36.701
A few hundred, maybe a thousand?

00:04:36.701 --> 00:04:38.200
Government doesn't release
the exact number.

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:39.734
It's somewhere in that ballpark.

00:04:39.734 --> 00:04:44.868
In the United States, there are
about 3.7 million babies, okay?

00:04:44.868 --> 00:04:48.567
So, clearly, the border babies
hogging all that formula

00:04:48.567 --> 00:04:50.200
is not the problem here.

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:51.501
[ Laughter ]
-This assumes, of course,

00:04:51.501 --> 00:04:53.267
that the doofuses
over at Fox News

00:04:53.267 --> 00:04:54.567
are capable of doing math.

00:04:54.567 --> 00:04:57.367
Have you ever really looked
in Brian Kilmeade's eyes?

00:04:57.367 --> 00:04:59.133
There is nothing there.

00:04:59.133 --> 00:05:02.868
[ Laughter ]
Sometimes I think he might
just be a nanny cam they set up

00:05:02.868 --> 00:05:04.934
to see if Steve Doocy
is stealing

00:05:04.934 --> 00:05:07.267
other people's lunch
from the staff fridge.

00:05:07.267 --> 00:05:08.434
[ Laughter ]

00:05:08.434 --> 00:05:09.601
Now, you no doubt heard

00:05:09.601 --> 00:05:11.567
about the nationwide
baby formula shortage,

00:05:11.567 --> 00:05:13.868
which is a very real
and horrifying crisis

00:05:13.868 --> 00:05:16.567
affecting millions of families,
that needs immediate action.

00:05:16.567 --> 00:05:18.534
There are several
contributing factors,

00:05:18.534 --> 00:05:20.033
including a recall in February

00:05:20.033 --> 00:05:22.367
by one of the nation's
largest manufacturers,

00:05:22.367 --> 00:05:24.200
which shuttered a plant
in Michigan;

00:05:24.200 --> 00:05:25.934
and supply chain disruptions
stemming

00:05:25.934 --> 00:05:27.300
from the COVID pandemic.

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:29.200
It's also been difficult
to supplement supply

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:31.167
with formula imported
from Canada,

00:05:31.167 --> 00:05:34.000
thanks, in part, to onerous
trade restrictions imposed

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:35.234
by the Trump administration.

00:05:35.234 --> 00:05:38.033
-Trade experts say
the renegotiated NAFTA deal

00:05:38.033 --> 00:05:40.801
under the Trump administration
made it nearly impossible

00:05:40.801 --> 00:05:44.667
for Canada to export formula
to the U.S.

00:05:44.667 --> 00:05:46.334
-During the Trump
administration,

00:05:46.334 --> 00:05:49.701
when they renegotiated NAFTA
and they made the USMCA,

00:05:49.701 --> 00:05:50.601
guess what they did?

00:05:50.601 --> 00:05:52.567
Made it harder for Canada,

00:05:52.567 --> 00:05:54.467
made it more expensive
for Canada

00:05:54.467 --> 00:05:56.467
to import baby formula here.

00:05:56.467 --> 00:05:58.701
-I mean, of course, Trump is,
somehow, involved in this.

00:05:58.701 --> 00:06:00.734
Finding his fingerprints
on a screw-up, these days,

00:06:00.734 --> 00:06:03.601
is like finding Waldo
in a book called...

00:06:03.601 --> 00:06:04.534
[ Laughter ]

00:06:04.534 --> 00:06:06.033
-Hey, that reminds me, Seth.

00:06:06.033 --> 00:06:07.234
-Reminds you of what, Wally?

00:06:07.234 --> 00:06:08.868
-I have a new kid's book
coming out called...

00:06:10.200 --> 00:06:11.501
It's pictures of me
in the studio

00:06:11.501 --> 00:06:12.734
and kids try to find me.

00:06:12.734 --> 00:06:14.100
[ Laughter ]

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:16.200
-Yeah, but aren't you always
in the same place,

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:17.734
holding cards behind the camera?

00:06:19.701 --> 00:06:22.634
[ Laughter ]

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:27.400
-Tha--

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:29.133
Thanks for ruining
my book, Seth.
-Alright.

00:06:29.133 --> 00:06:32.734
[ Laughter ]

00:06:32.734 --> 00:06:34.634
[ Applause ]
Yeah, I --

00:06:37.267 --> 00:06:39.400
-Whoo!
-Apologies, everyone.

00:06:39.400 --> 00:06:42.234
The new restrictions
on formula imports from Canada

00:06:42.234 --> 00:06:45.267
were implemented as part
of a renegotiated trade deal

00:06:45.267 --> 00:06:46.834
called the USMCA.

00:06:46.834 --> 00:06:49.901
Trump even branded it
and came up with a very dumb way

00:06:49.901 --> 00:06:51.434
of getting people
to remember the name.

00:06:51.434 --> 00:06:54.167
-USMCA, right?

00:06:54.167 --> 00:06:56.200
Like
♪ YMCA ♪

00:06:56.200 --> 00:06:57.300
[ Laughter ]

00:06:57.300 --> 00:06:58.701
If you have a problem
remembering it,

00:06:58.701 --> 00:07:00.868
just think of the song
"Y.M.C.A."

00:07:00.868 --> 00:07:02.734
We love that song.

00:07:02.734 --> 00:07:04.734
USMCA.

00:07:04.734 --> 00:07:06.367
-[ As Trump ]
Just think of the YMCA

00:07:06.367 --> 00:07:08.033
and, of course,
the Village People.

00:07:08.033 --> 00:07:10.200
Think of the cop, the cowboy,
and, of course,

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:11.200
the leather daddy.

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:13.400
[ Laughter ]
Leather comes from cows,

00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:14.534
cows produce milk,

00:07:14.534 --> 00:07:16.534
and dairy imports are regulated
by the

00:07:16.534 --> 00:07:18.801
♪ USMCA ♪

00:07:18.801 --> 00:07:19.534
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:07:19.534 --> 00:07:20.701
It rolls off the tongue.

00:07:20.701 --> 00:07:22.701
It's very natural
when you do it.

00:07:22.701 --> 00:07:24.334
[ Laughter ]

00:07:24.334 --> 00:07:26.868
So there are lots of reasons
for the formula shortage

00:07:26.868 --> 00:07:29.000
and those problems
have been magnified by the fact

00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:30.834
that the formula market
is largely controlled

00:07:30.834 --> 00:07:32.501
by a small handful
of corporate monopolies.

00:07:45.367 --> 00:07:46.567
Yeah, because you can't have

00:07:46.567 --> 00:07:48.501
a small group of companies
all depending

00:07:48.501 --> 00:07:50.267
on the same sources
for the same ingredients,

00:07:50.267 --> 00:07:52.067
otherwise, crises like these
will be inevitable.

00:07:52.067 --> 00:07:55.067
It's like if the only place
you could go

00:07:55.067 --> 00:07:57.300
to get yourself clean,
have a good meal,

00:07:57.300 --> 00:07:59.934
and...do whatever you feel
was the

00:07:59.934 --> 00:08:01.367
-♪ YMCA ♪

00:08:01.367 --> 00:08:05.601
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:05.601 --> 00:08:06.968
Does make it easier to remember.

00:08:06.968 --> 00:08:08.701
[ Laughter ]
So...

00:08:08.701 --> 00:08:11.968
Now, obviously, obviously, it is
on the Biden administration

00:08:11.968 --> 00:08:14.067
and Congress
to fix the crisis immediately.

00:08:14.067 --> 00:08:15.634
Biden announced
that he's invoking

00:08:15.634 --> 00:08:18.133
the Defense Production Act
to produce more formula,

00:08:18.133 --> 00:08:20.801
the FDA reached a deal
to open the shuttered plant,

00:08:20.801 --> 00:08:22.734
and the House passed
an emergency funding bill

00:08:22.734 --> 00:08:23.767
to address the crisis.

00:08:23.767 --> 00:08:25.467
And yet, you'll never guess
who voted

00:08:25.467 --> 00:08:27.133
against the emergency
funding bill.

00:08:27.133 --> 00:08:28.601
Wait, sorry,
of course you can guess.

00:08:28.601 --> 00:08:30.033
Almost every Republican.

00:08:30.033 --> 00:08:32.434
-We'll start with a bill
that would send $28 million

00:08:32.434 --> 00:08:34.434
to the Food and Drug
Administration

00:08:34.434 --> 00:08:38.434
to help boost formula supply
and prevent future shortages.

00:08:38.434 --> 00:08:40.868
Only 12 Republicans voted
for that measure.

00:08:40.868 --> 00:08:43.234
House Democrats say the
emergency funding would be used

00:08:43.234 --> 00:08:46.300
to increase the number
of FDA inspection staff,

00:08:46.300 --> 00:08:49.100
help the agency stop
fraudulent baby formula

00:08:49.100 --> 00:08:51.000
from entering
the U.S. marketplace,

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:54.200
and improve data collection
on the formula market.

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:55.934
-Only 12 Republicans voted
for a bill

00:08:55.934 --> 00:08:57.701
to address the nationwide
formula shortage.

00:08:57.701 --> 00:08:59.033
You know,
I'm starting to suspect

00:08:59.033 --> 00:09:01.167
that maybe their criticisms
aren't exactly genuine.

00:09:01.167 --> 00:09:04.300
I mean, when I saw
that 192 Republicans voted

00:09:04.300 --> 00:09:06.534
against an emergency funding
bill for the FDA,

00:09:06.534 --> 00:09:07.634
my first question was...

00:09:07.634 --> 00:09:08.367
-♪ Y ♪

00:09:08.367 --> 00:09:09.300
-Seriously.

00:09:09.300 --> 00:09:12.300
[ Laughter ]

00:09:12.300 --> 00:09:14.167
How can you be
against a bill like that?

00:09:14.167 --> 00:09:15.934
It's like being the one guy
in the office who's

00:09:15.934 --> 00:09:17.434
against free pizza for lunch.

00:09:17.434 --> 00:09:19.467
"I'm sorry. What am I supposed
to do with the catfish

00:09:19.467 --> 00:09:21.033
I just warmed up
in the microwave?"

00:09:21.033 --> 00:09:22.100
[ Laughter ]

00:09:22.100 --> 00:09:24.000
So, the House passed two bills.

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:26.267
One was an emergency funding
bill to address the shortage,

00:09:26.267 --> 00:09:28.067
and almost every Republican
voted against it.

00:09:28.067 --> 00:09:30.167
Another bill
would make it easier

00:09:30.167 --> 00:09:32.300
for low-income families
to buy formula,

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:35.667
and that bill got much more
bipartisan support.

00:09:35.667 --> 00:09:37.501
-The House also passed
another bill,

00:09:37.501 --> 00:09:40.033
called the
Access to Baby Formula Act.

00:09:40.033 --> 00:09:43.701
That final vote came down 414-9

00:09:43.701 --> 00:09:46.033
and the bill would allow
more formula to be purchased

00:09:46.033 --> 00:09:47.434
with money
from a federal program

00:09:47.434 --> 00:09:51.334
that aids low-income women,
infants, and children.

00:09:51.334 --> 00:09:53.267
-Supporting a bill like that
would seem like a no-brainer

00:09:53.267 --> 00:09:54.934
and, yet, somehow, there were
still nine Republicans

00:09:54.934 --> 00:09:57.133
who voted against it --
Andy Biggs, of Arizona...

00:10:07.701 --> 00:10:10.567
Hearing that list of names
is like hearing the roll call

00:10:10.567 --> 00:10:12.734
at a Legion of Doom meeting.
[ Laughter ]

00:10:12.734 --> 00:10:14.634
I mean, who else voted
against this bill,

00:10:14.634 --> 00:10:16.467
Skeletor? I'm just kidding.
[ Laughter ]

00:10:16.467 --> 00:10:18.367
I'm just kidding.
Skeletor's not in Congress.

00:10:18.367 --> 00:10:20.334
He's the president's lawyer.

00:10:20.334 --> 00:10:21.901
[ Laughter, ohs, and applause ]
You guys.

00:10:21.901 --> 00:10:23.734
Also, I got to say,
at least, with Skeletor,

00:10:23.734 --> 00:10:25.200
you know what you're getting.
Dude's a giant,

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:26.501
maniacal skeleton in a hoodie.

00:10:26.501 --> 00:10:27.701
He's upfront about being evil.

00:10:27.701 --> 00:10:29.200
[ Laughter ]
He-Man's under no illusions

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:30.300
about who he's dealing with.

00:10:30.300 --> 00:10:32.133
He-Man never started
an episode saying,

00:10:32.133 --> 00:10:34.501
"Hey, maybe we should hear
Skeletor out."

00:10:34.501 --> 00:10:35.367
[ Laughter ]

00:10:35.367 --> 00:10:36.934
The nationwide formula shortage

00:10:36.934 --> 00:10:39.234
is an urgent crisis
that requires immediate action

00:10:39.234 --> 00:10:40.434
and, yet, for all their bluster,

00:10:40.434 --> 00:10:42.067
Republicans have, once again,
made it clear

00:10:42.067 --> 00:10:43.534
they have no interest
in actually governing

00:10:43.534 --> 00:10:44.767
or helping solve the problem.

00:10:44.767 --> 00:10:46.534
If you're feeling down,
they just want you

00:10:46.534 --> 00:10:48.734
to pick yourself off the ground

00:10:48.734 --> 00:10:50.534
because you're in a new town

00:10:50.534 --> 00:10:51.701
[ Laughter ]
and head to the...

00:10:51.701 --> 00:10:53.200
-USMCA.

00:10:53.200 --> 00:10:54.133
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:10:54.133 --> 00:10:56.067
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:10:56.067 --> 00:10:59.067
♪♪

00:10:59.067 --> 00:11:00.767
God's Love We Deliver
cooks and brings

00:11:00.767 --> 00:11:02.067
over two million meals a year

00:11:02.067 --> 00:11:04.767
to men, women, and children
living with HIV/AIDS,

00:11:04.767 --> 00:11:06.200
cancer, and other
serious illnesses

00:11:06.200 --> 00:11:07.701
and they need your help,
now, more than ever.

00:11:07.701 --> 00:11:09.667
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the Donate button.

00:11:09.667 --> 00:11:12.467
Stay safe. Get vaccinated.
We love you.

